# data/risk_model.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is 20 KB, but training
# it takes ~200 s on a laptop and far longer on a throttled free-tier CPU, so
# a deployment that had to rebuild it at start-up would time out and ship with
# no model at all. The database beside it stays ignored because seeding is
# fast (~1.3 s) and reproducible from the committed corpus.

